"running which use it as their own net qube. But in case the net qube stops "
"for whatever reason (e.g. it crashes, or the user forces its shutdown via "
"qvm-kill via terminal in Dom0), Qubes OS will often automatically repair the "
"connection. If it does not, then there is an easy way to restore the "
"connection to the net qube by issuing the following command in dom0:"
msgstr ""

